MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b71d7f6f7d77720459e951f4d068c803, type: 3}
  m_Name: D_Ending3_HologramInTheDust
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Morsoul.Cutscene::Morsoul.Cutscene.CutsceneData
  id: D_Ending3_HologramInTheDust
  shots:
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 6
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: "Do you think you can bind me with paper warrants, machine?! Magic is a parasitic tumor! When the mana tides drain, the beastfolk and spirits dissolve\u2014and our ritual is merciful purification!"
    captionSpeaker: Grand Overseer
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 6
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: Falsehood. Your own private journal proved mana is the planetary circulatory fluid maintaining tectonic stability. Purging it will collapse the crust and extinguish all life.
    captionSpeaker: Golem
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 6
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: You're not a doctor curing an infection. You're an arsonist burning down the house because you despise the children living inside it.
    captionSpeaker: Eliza
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 6
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: "You dare lecture me?! Everything we wield is cold First-Age mechanics! Brass conduits, extraction pylons\u2014there is no witchcraft in steel!"
    captionSpeaker: Grand Overseer
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 6
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: Your staff burns with the exact dark mana signature forged into Saint Althea's bell clapper. Humanity caused the First-Age catastrophe; your entire operation runs on corrupted mana.
    captionSpeaker: Golem
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 6
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: You wrapped yourself in First-Age science because you couldn't admit to your own disciples that you're just another warlock drinking stolen power.
    captionSpeaker: Eliza
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 6
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: "It does not matter! The grounding is gone! When the core reaches saturation, the tectonic plates shatter\u2014and we all burn together!"
    captionSpeaker: Grand Overseer
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 6
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: 'Your collapse is preventable. The central console holds an emergency stabilization shunt: a conscious analytical soul core can bridge the polarity circuit directly.'
    captionSpeaker: Golem
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 6
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: You built your cult on the lie that humanity was weak, Overseer. Three thousand years ago, two humans gave everything to protect this earth. And we are still standing here.
    captionSpeaker: Eliza
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 6
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: (Eliza kicks the Grand Overseer's ceremonial staff over the chasm brink as sirens shriek across the dais.)
    captionSpeaker: 
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 1.8
    waitForInput: 0
    caption: '>> WARNING: PRIMARY GROUND SEVERED

      >> POLARITY INVERSION AT 94%

      >> MANUAL CORE BRIDGING REQUIRED WITHIN 15 SECONDS'
    captionSpeaker: System
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 6
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: It requires a conscious mana core to absorb the polarity backlash and lock the seal permanently.
    captionSpeaker: Golem
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 6
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: (Eyes wide with terror, seizing the Golem's arm) {PlayerName}, wait... If you absorb that charge, your chassis won't survive the feedback!
    captionSpeaker: Eliza
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 6
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: All four Runic Ciphers aligned. Primary soul matrix unlocking... I do not need the Guild's breaker. I remember the oath we swore in Section Zero.
    captionSpeaker: Golem
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 6
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: '>> AUTHORIZATION VERIFIED: DETECTIVE ARTHUR C. DAYLE

      >> STABILIZATION FORMULA: RECONSTRUCTED

      >> MANUAL OVERRIDE REQUIRED: DIRECT NEURAL / CORE ENGAGEMENT'
    captionSpeaker: System
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 6
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: Arthur, no! The voltage will burn out your core! Break the link!
    captionSpeaker: Eliza
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 6
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: The containment seal cannot hold without a conscious anchor, Eliza... It was never a machine's duty. It was mine.
    captionSpeaker: Arthur
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 6
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: 'Three thousand years in the dark... and I remembered the cases, the evidence, the laws...

      But I had forgotten the only truth that ever mattered.

      I remember you, Elise.'
    captionSpeaker: Arthur
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 6
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: Keep this safe... partner. I love you.
    captionSpeaker: Arthur
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 6
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: I've got it, Arthur. Rest now. The case is closed.
    captionSpeaker: Eliza
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 6
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: (Five years later. The Investigator's Guild Historical Archive. On the Chief Investigator's desk, the dormant brass optic core begins to pulse with a warm, steady golden light.)
    captionSpeaker: 
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 6
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: Case file logged, Operative Cochran. Ready to submit to the magistrate?
    captionSpeaker: Holo-Arthur
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 6
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: Only if you're buying coffee on the way back, Detective.
    captionSpeaker: Holo-Elise
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 6
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: (Laughing) Deal.
    captionSpeaker: Holo-Arthur
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 6
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: 'Empires fall to ash, and memory fades into myth.

      Yet through catastrophe, stone, and time...

      The soul remembers.'
    captionSpeaker: 
  nextSceneName: 
  skipToScene: 1
